# Allowlist: everything is ignored unless it is listed below, so model files, client data
# and deployment credentials can never be committed by accident. Add new files here on purpose.
*

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!LICENSE
!app.R
!functions.R
!renv.lock
!run_app.R
!run_app.bat
!App.Rproj

!demo/
!demo/motor_premiums.rds

!docs/
!docs/*.md
!docs/images/
!docs/images/*.png
